---
description: Catalog barcodes are unique per company, never globally
globs: catalog-service/**/*
---

# Catalog barcode uniqueness

- Barcodes (`products.barcode` and `product_barcodes.barcode`) are unique **within a company only**.
- Same barcode across different `company_id` values is allowed (matches grocery `pos_db`).
- Do **not** reintroduce global `UNIQUE(barcode)` or `existsByBarcode(code)` without company scope.
- Use `ProductBarcodeUniqueness.assertAvailable(companyId, barcode, excludeProductId)`.
